  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0BFB">Lemma <span data-tag="0BFB">39.9.3</span>.</a> Let $k$ be a field. Let $A$ be an abelian variety over $k$. For any field extension $K/k$ the base change $A_ K$ is an abelian variety over $K$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
